tellraw @a {"translate":"%1$s has found the hidden advancement %2$s%3$s%4$s","with":[{"selector":"@s"},{"color":"light_purple","text":"["},{"color":"light_purple","text":"Riddle Me Azure Bluet: A Sequel","hover_event":{"action":"show_text","value":{"color":"light_purple","translate":"Riddle Me Azure Bluet: A Sequel","extra":[{"text":"\n"},{"color":"#DE4ADC","translate":"The first is to meet an ancient fish and use an azure bluet to land a crit,\nThe second is to rename a stack of azure bluets to \"The Great Flower\" in Sanskrit,\nThe third is to feed an azure bluet to an electrified calf,\nThe fourth is to help a farmer by using an azure bluet as some draff,\nThe fifth is to get an azure bluet in the night, but not for free,\nThe sixth is to use it to feed a childish bee,\nThe seventh is to rescue a prisoner and gift them a azure bluet bouquet,\nThe eighth is to craft an explosion colored as an azure bluet - light gray,\nThe ninth is to pot an azure bluet in the dark for the blind to scent,\nThe tenth is to end up inside azure bluet colored cement,\nThe eleventh is to load the strongest llama with azure bluets,\nThe twelfth is to smash a black azure bluet thief with a mace,\nThe thirteenth is to plant an azure bluet on a weird dirty block,\nThe fourteenth is to do the same, except above the long lasting rock,\nThe fifteenth is to fill up your inventory with azure bluets, including the other hand,\nThe sixteenth is to plant an azure bluet in a city at the game's end,\nThe seventeenth is to use an azure bluet to turn blind,\nThe eighteenth is to win against a zombie in an azure bluet fight,\nThe nineteenth is to plant an azure bluet while doing the Skyblock advancement,\nThe twentieth is to hit the sack in an azure bluet's remains, then you'll receive the source of azure bluet's great power, but with a great enhancement.\n\nSuggested by yakishbek"},{"text":"\n\n"},{"color":"gray","italic":true,"translate":"%1$s tab","with":[{"translate":"Biomes"}]}]}}},{"color":"light_purple","text":"]"}]}